        summaryEn: 'Green wet wood resists burning, yet the Quran highlights that Allah made fire specifically from "the green tree." Biochemistry confirms green chlorophyll is Earth\'s solar factory—converting sunlight into combustible carbohydrates that power fire, wood, and fossil fuels.',
